  {
    "source": "Certain events in this game affects the sanity and composure of your character. One of the main threats to your mental health are the various horrifying creatures that inhabit the game world. When inside your view, some creatures may cause a vague unease, while others are very disturbing to behold. Your mind also takes a hit when you use occult powers, carry weird artifacts, or stand in darkness, etc. Finally, there is a slow perpetual taxing of your mind from exploring and dwelling in this haunted dungeon.",
    "target": "游戏中的某些事件会影响角色的理智与镇定。精神健康面临的主要威胁之一，是游戏世界中各种骇人的生物。有些生物进入视野后会让你隐隐不安，另一些则令人极度恐惧。使用神秘力量、携带诡异圣物、身处黑暗等也会冲击心智。最后，在这座闹鬼地牢中探索和停留，也会持续缓慢地消磨你的心智。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/manual.txt:208"
